-tutorial-create-a-flow","line":29},{"title":"Steps to create a custom activity in Creator Studio","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/application-development/creator-studio/creator-studio-custom-activity-workflow.md","line":31},{"title":"Make a custom activity available for playbooks in Creator Studio","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/application-development/creator-studio/creator-studio-add-custom-activity.md","line":33},{"title":"Reorder how activities appear in a playbook's activity picker","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/application-development/creator-studio/creator-studio-reorder-activities.md","line":35},{"title":"Make an activity unavailable in playbooks","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/application-development/creator-studio/creator-studio-hide-activity.md","line":37},{"title":"Administering Creator Studio","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/application-development/creator-studio/administering-creator-studio.md","line":40},{"title":"Creator Studio","target":"creator-studio-landing","line":44},{"title":"Create a flow","target":"app-tutorial-create-a-flow","line":45}],"metadata":{"title":"Administering activities in Creator Studio","description":"As an admin, you can define custom activities, make them available in Creator Studio, and hide existing activities to help guide users when they add automation to apps.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/application-development/creator-studio/creator-studio-administering-activities.html","release":"australia","product":"Creator Studio","classification":"creator-studio","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":1,"breadcrumb":["Administer","Creator Studio","Building no-code applica